{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happens when reality glitches and you fall through the cracks?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric psychological horror experience, you awaken in the liminal expanse known only as the <strong>Backrooms</strong>. <br>  <i>Welcome to the Backrooms:</i> the hum of fluorescent lights and the smell of damp, musty carpets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place outside of time and space.   <br>A place you're not supposed to be.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/12edf9c2f24d471df1ea6c387553ae8b.webp?t=1772554172\" width=1200 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/16a457d35c54b00a68d9cfb5856d08ec.poster.avif?t=1772554172\" width=1048 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/16a457d35c54b00a68d9cfb5856d08ec.webm?t=1772554172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/16a457d35c54b00a68d9cfb5856d08ec.mp4?t=1772554172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/ecdc3328bcaccb372b30bde8b7834fb3.webp?t=1772554172\" width=1200 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/bef93a4d5d43b41cbf30f52f60c22cca.avif?t=1772554172\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/extras/aabcd84367a0736d8cdfdcf08e557e38.webp?t=1772554172\" width=1200 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or join friends in online co-op. To survive, you\u2019ll need to communicate to avoid getting lost, share vital clues, and solve environmental puzzles as a team. Some paths can only be traversed together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This experience combines eerie, dreamlike levels, exploration-based puzzles, ambient soundscapes, and subtle horror to create a unique balance of mystery, survival, and discovery. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hit the wishlist button!</strong> Ensure you get notified upon release so you don't miss out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673500?t=1772554172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/cb763ba8660986da6f8ae456100738b1a6dd0d1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772554172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/f50e505df7bac219b0941e9d457c09507f0c659d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772554172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673500/f50e505df7bac219b0941e9d457c09507f0c659d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772554172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happens when reality glitches and you fall through the cracks?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric psychological horror experience, you awaken in the liminal expanse known only as the <strong>Backrooms</strong>. <br>  <i>Welco